---
// SeoFoundation.astro (Jasa Website Company Profile)
---

<section class="seo-section" id="seo">
  <div class="seo-container">
    <div class="seo-layout">
      <div class="seo-content animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 100ms;">
        <div class="header-eyebrow">
          <span class="eyebrow-dot">●</span> SEO FOUNDATION
        </div>
        <h2 class="header-title">Struktur Website yang Disukai Google</h2>
        <p class="header-intro">
          Website yang bagus tidak akan berguna jika tidak ada yang menemukannya. Kami membangun fondasi SEO On-Page sejak hari pertama, memastikan website Anda siap bersaing di halaman pencarian Google.
        </p>

        <ul class="seo-list">
          <li>
            <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
            <span><strong>Semantic HTML:</strong> Tag yang terstruktur jelas (H1, H2, dll) membantu robot Google memahami konten Anda.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
            <span><strong>Meta & Open Graph:</strong> Tampilan rapi saat link website dibagikan di WhatsApp, LinkedIn, atau media sosial lain.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
            <span><strong>Auto-generated Sitemap:</strong> Peta situs XML yang secara otomatis terupdate setiap kali ada halaman baru.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="check-icon">✓</div>
            <span><strong>Mobile-Friendly Indexing:</strong> Optimasi untuk algoritma Mobile-First Indexing dari Google.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-visual animate-fade-scroll" style="animation-delay: 250ms;">
        <div class="google-mockup">
          <div class="search-bar">
            <div class="search-icon"></div>
            <div class="search-text">jasa <span class="highlight">spesialisasi bisnis anda</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="search-result">
            <div class="result-url">https://www.perusahaananda.com</div>
            <div class="result-title">Perusahaan Anda | Jasa Spesialisasi Terbaik di Indonesia</div>
            <div class="result-desc">Kami menyediakan solusi B2B terbaik untuk perusahaan Anda dengan pengalaman lebih dari 10 tahun dan portofolio yang terpercaya.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .seo-section {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 100px 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .seo-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .seo-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .header-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .eyebrow-dot {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-size: 8px;
  }

  .header-title {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
  }

  .header-intro {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #7D96C5;
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
  }

  .seo-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .seo-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .seo-list li strong {
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .check-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.15);
    color: #22c55e;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: bold;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .seo-visual {
    background: rgba(13, 20, 34, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 132, 255, 0.2);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 30px;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .google-mockup {
    background: #1e293b;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
  }

  .search-bar {
    background: #0f172a;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 24px;
    height: 44px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 16px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .search-icon {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border: 2px solid #64748b;
    border-radius: 50%;
    position: relative;
    margin-right: 12px;
  }

  .search-icon::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -4px;
    right: -4px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 2px;
    background: #64748b;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .search-text {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: #f8fafc;
  }

  .search-result {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .result-url {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .result-title {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #60a5fa;
  }

  .result-desc {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  /* Animations */
  .animate-fade-scroll {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(15px);
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  /* Light Theme Specific Adjustments */
  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .seo-section {
    background-color: #F8FAFC;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-title {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .header-intro {
    color: #475569;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .seo-list li {
    color: #64748b;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .seo-list li strong {
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .seo-visual {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .google-mockup {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .search-bar {
    background: #F1F5F9;
    border-color: #E2E8F0;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .search-text {
    color: #475569;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .highlight {
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .result-url {
    color: #475569;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .result-title {
    color: #2563eb;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme="light"]) .result-desc {
    color: #64748b;
  }

  @media (max-width: 991px) {
    .seo-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .seo-section {
      padding: 60px 16px;
    }
    
    .header-title {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
